<% if @greeting_name -%>
Hi <%= @greeting_name %>, here's your <%= @app_name %> sign-in link.
<% else -%>
Here's your <%= @app_name %> sign-in link.
<% end -%>

Someone, hopefully you, asked to sign in to <%= @app_name %> at <%= @site_host %>.
Open this link to finish signing in. If you're new, it creates your account;
there's no password to remember.

<%= @magic_url %>

The link works once and only for a short while. If it has stopped working,
ask for a new one on the sign-in page.

Didn't ask to sign in? You can ignore this email. Nobody can sign in without
the link.
